             "R": ["Actors\\Character\\slavetats\\Collygon - Wounds\\Face\\Bruise - Right Cheek (F).dds", "Actors\\Character\\slavetats\\Collygon - Wounds\\Face\\Bruise - Right Cheek.dds"] },
